# Full local validation before anything leaves the machine. Identical to the pre-PR command in
# .claude/gh-project.md.
#
# Covers ESLint, Prettier, the workspace checks (check:skills, check:env, check:catalog), the frontend
# and backend unit suites, and — only through `build` — type-checking, which neither lint nor test
# performs. The backend integration and e2e suites are deliberately out: they need Postgres and a
# .env.test.
#
# No shebang and no `set -e`: husky runs this file as `sh -e "$0"`, so it needs neither an
# interpreter line nor an executable bit, and `&&` already stops at the first failure.
pnpm lint && pnpm test && pnpm build
